$\begin{align}
x&=\dfrac{-\blueD{b} \pm \sqrt{\blueD{b}^2-4\greenD{a}\purpleC{c}}}{2\greenD{a}}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{-(\blueD{-10}) \pm \sqrt{(\blueD{-10})^2-4(\greenD{3})(\purpleC{-8})}}{2(\greenD{3})}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{10 \pm \sqrt{100-(-96)}}{6}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{10 \pm \sqrt{196}}{6}
\\\\
x&=\dfrac{10 \pm 14}{6}
\\\\
&x=\dfrac{24}{6}\text{ or }x=\dfrac{-4}{6}
\\\\
&x=4\text{ or }x=-\dfrac{2}{3}
\end{align}$
